      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَلَدٌ</span></b>  The <i>mind:</i> (S, A, K:) the <i>heart:</i> (S, K:)
pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَخْلَادٌ</span>. (TA.) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَقَعَ ذٰلِكَ فِى خَلَدِى</span>
<i>That came into my mind,</i> or <i>heart.</i> (S.)

